{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eternal Voyager is a classic action RPG set in a universe overrun by monsters, spiders, robots, and freaks. Take on the role of a living weapon unleashed to stop the source of a catastrophic event that threatens to destroy all worlds. Discover the secrets of these worlds, master unique yet deadly gunplay, and defeat legendary bosses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You were raised as the ultimate weapon, a soldier. Unleashing this potential will require many difficult lessons in a ruthless universe filled with murderous enemies. Expect no mercy or help on your journey: those who don't try to kill you will try to use you for their own gain. Trust no one. Except, of course, Blast and Mini Bot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast and Mini Bot will be your traveling companions. They will be of great help to you on this adventure. Blast is grumpy, angry, and a master tactician, while Mini Bot is a more naive and incredibly intelligent robot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Blast's tactics and Mini Bot's strategies to succeed in this terrifying universe and stop the invaders.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Featured Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff0 Weapon Upgrades</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can upgrade multiple weapons. A higher-level weapon becomes a more lethal weapon.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can upgrade many weapons, from pistols and assault rifles to electric rifles and swords. This requires both basic and advanced components.</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/3daef63021a0eba2df9a470d307b6dec.poster.avif?t=1761849717\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/3daef63021a0eba2df9a470d307b6dec.webm?t=1761849717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/3daef63021a0eba2df9a470d307b6dec.mp4?t=1761849717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Deep and Tactical Combat System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth combat awaits you, whether with a variety of swords or guns. Each weapon deals different damage and creates different effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/8f45eb9e342d8ea8c4be8e6aea2c34b7.poster.avif?t=1761849717\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/8f45eb9e342d8ea8c4be8e6aea2c34b7.webm?t=1761849717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/8f45eb9e342d8ea8c4be8e6aea2c34b7.mp4?t=1761849717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfad Story &amp; Decision Mechanics</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the invasion, there are only a few people left in this universe capable of resisting the invaders. You, Blast, and Mini Bot are among those joining this resistance.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the story, you'll be faced with various choices. For example, you'll have the choice of going right or left. If you go left, a different battle awaits you; if you go right, a different battle awaits you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, there are detailed information about the level at the beginning of each level. You can listen to this information if you prefer. Or, you can ignore it and immediately begin the battle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/f77f8f3dc27d3d47efbfa972f53ec3c3.poster.avif?t=1761849717\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/f77f8f3dc27d3d47efbfa972f53ec3c3.webm?t=1761849717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/f77f8f3dc27d3d47efbfa972f53ec3c3.mp4?t=1761849717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/f1193944ebbdf0330d599fe1c81ccd90.poster.avif?t=1761849717\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/f1193944ebbdf0330d599fe1c81ccd90.webm?t=1761849717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/f1193944ebbdf0330d599fe1c81ccd90.mp4?t=1761849717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Chests and Various Rewards</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chests are available in all levels. These chests drop various items based on their respective probabilities. For example, 10% ammo, 50% plasma ammo, 5% healing kit, and 35% gold. These probabilities vary depending on the chest.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/5658d732aa92e68d886a4169e322aa8e.poster.avif?t=1761849717\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/5658d732aa92e68d886a4169e322aa8e.webm?t=1761849717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/5658d732aa92e68d886a4169e322aa8e.mp4?t=1761849717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Purchasable Weapons, Ammo, and More</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy you kill earns you a reward. These rewards can be used to purchase new weapons, armor, ammo, and more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/05567267e3604a364e292e9b2c3bbf29.poster.avif?t=1761849717\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/05567267e3604a364e292e9b2c3bbf29.webm?t=1761849717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/05567267e3604a364e292e9b2c3bbf29.mp4?t=1761849717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\uded2 Follow &amp; Wishlist the Game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Don't forget to wishlist Eternal Voyager! Don't miss the release date and be one of the first to play! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udce2 Follow us on Discord and social media to stay updated on developer updates!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3618870?t=1761849717","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/70ac