st and Mini Bot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blast and Mini Bot will be your traveling companions. They will be of great help to you on this adventure. Blast is grumpy, angry, and a master tactician, while Mini Bot is a more naive and incredibly intelligent robot.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Blast's tactics and Mini Bot's strategies to succeed in this terrifying universe and stop the invaders.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Featured Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udff0 Weapon Upgrades</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can upgrade multiple weapons. A higher-level weapon becomes a more lethal weapon.</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can upgrade many weapons, from pistols and assault rifles to electric rifles and swords. This requires both basic and advanced components.</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/3daef63021a0eba2df9a470d307b6dec.poster.avif?t=1761849717\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/3daef63021a0eba2df9a470d307b6dec.webm?t=1761849717\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618870/extras/3daef63021a0eba2df9a470d307b6dec.mp4?t=1761849717\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f Deep and Tactical Combat System</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth combat awaits you, whether with a variety of swords or guns. Each weapon deals different damage and creates different effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mu